#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:12
msgid ""
"Monthly plans are paid by card via Stripe, or by bank transfer against an"
" invoice. Annual plans are invoiced and paid by bank transfer — two "
"months free. Enterprise customers always receive an invoice. We are not "
"VAT-registered, so the listed price is final and no VAT is added."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:14
msgid ""
"Yes — we currently invoice by bank transfer, monthly or annually (annual "
"= two months free). Online card payment is being set up; until then just "
"write to team@assoluto.eu when your trial ends. We are not VAT-"
"registered, so the listed price is final and no VAT is added."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:18
msgid "Where is my data stored?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:19
msgid ""
"In Germany (EU), at Hetzner Online GmbH: the application and database run"
" on a Hetzner server, drawings and attachments are kept in Hetzner Object"
" Storage. Emails are delivered through Brevo (France, EU). The database "
"is backed up daily and backups are kept for 14 days. The full "
"subprocessor list is in our Privacy Policy."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:20
msgid "Can I pay by bank transfer, not just by card?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:21
msgid "Do I need to sign anything?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:22
msgid ""
"No paper contract. At signup you accept our Terms of Service by clicking "
"a button. Subscriptions are monthly with no commitment; cancel any time "
"from your account settings. After cancellation you have 3 days to export "
"your data, then access ends. For later recovery, email team@assoluto.eu "
"within 30 days."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:23
msgid "Can I integrate with Pohoda or Money S3?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:24
msgid ""
"Assoluto does not replace your accounting software, it runs next to it. "
"Orders and customers can be exported to CSV at any time. There is no two-"
"way synchronisation with Pohoda or Money S3. If that is a deciding "
"factor, write to us — customer demand directly shapes what we build next."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:25
msgid "Is it secure? What if the server fails?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:26
msgid ""
"Each client sees only their own data — enforced by the database itself "
"(PostgreSQL Row-Level Security), not just by the application. Passwords "
"are stored only as Argon2id hashes and logins are rate-limited. The "
"database is backed up daily and backups are kept for 14 days. Starter and"
" Pro come without a formal SLA; Enterprise customers can agree a written "
"one. Details are on our security page."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:27
msgid "Will you teach my people how to use it?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:28
msgid ""
"Every paid plan includes a 30-minute online walkthrough — we show the "
"system with your actual setup, not demo data. Most shops do not need it: "
"the portal is designed so a client who can use email can place their "
"first order in 3 minutes without training. Need more? Contact us."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:29
msgid "What if I want to leave?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/www/_home_faq.html:30
msgid ""
"Cancel in your account settings — no sales call, no approval queue. You "
"keep full access until the current billing period ends, then have 3 days "
"to export your data (orders and customers as CSV, attachments as ZIP). "
"After that, access ends. Need to recover something later? Email "
"team@assoluto.eu within 30 days. For immediate erasure (GDPR Art. 17) "
"email us — we action requests within 48 hours."
msgstr ""

